invalid type: string "Implementation Phase\nBuild, test, and deploy the system.\nSteps:\n1 System Construction:\nCoding.\nUnit testing.\nIntegration testing.\n2 System Testing:\nSystem testing.\nUser acceptance testing (UAT).\n3 Deployment:\nDirect cutover.\nParallel run.\nPhased implementation.\nDeliverables:\nSource Code.\nTest Reports.\nDeployment Guide.\nTraining Materials.\nMaintenance Plan.ÿ